{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前は特典イベントで黒ひげのゲームをしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"負けたり勝ったり、機械の不具合だったりと色々あったけど\n至近距離で一緒に遊べるっていうのは滅多にないから新鮮で楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一発めで黒ひげ飛んだときはさすがに笑っちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間を作ってわざわざ来てくださり本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして応募してくださった方も本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなりだけど埼スタライブの時の傾斜の衣装好きなんだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして乃木天！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出会ったフクロウちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が可愛すぎてまたあのお店行きたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初はちょっと怖いなーって思ってたけど実際見てみるとみんな可愛くて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←こんなハートの目になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よちよち❤かわいいねほんとに君達は"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サムライELOの連載の時の写真"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月24発売です！是非見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は愛犬の誕生日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PV見てくださった方はわかると思うんですけど映像に出てくる桜の絵\n高校で美術をとってたからかここで発揮できたなー！！！！！と思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな大きく大胆に書いたことはないけど\n書く時すごく楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一本の太い桜の木って素敵だなって書きながら思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監督さんはタナカシンゴ監督です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の個人PVに関わってくださった方がとっても温かくて優しくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビューの撮影も素直に自分からお話しできて...いい作品にしていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学1年生での上京時の心情から高校卒業までの今が収められています。\n是非まだ見てない方はよかったら見てください。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/21/8119523/0020.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}